          "text": "Eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Right eye red, itchy, and watery for 3 days; left eye mildly affected yesterday, symptoms mainly right-sided. Itch prominent; mild gritty feeling. Clear watery, sometimes stringy mucus discharge. No purulent discharge or crusting."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
