        "code": {
          "text": "Relevant exposure and history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Similar symptoms each spring, usually settle with over-the-counter lubricants. Changed eye cream and makeup remover about one week ago and recently started new over-the-counter eye drops, likely preservative-containing. No contact lens use, trauma, foreign body, or recent upper respiratory infection."
      }
